        "type": "Module",
        "name": "power_3v3",
        "description": "XC6206 LDO regulator converts the external VIN_5V USB supply into the internal VCC_3V3 logic rail. This module is the sole provider of VCC_3V3 for downstream logic. U2 uses VIN and VSS from the global rails and exposes VOUT as VCC_3V3. Output bypassing and regulator stability support are owned inside this power module during downstream implementation.",
